insky</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Honig</surname><given-names>B</given-names></name><name><surname>Mann</surname><given-names>RS</given-names></name><name><surname>Califano</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Discovering transcriptional regulatory regions in <italic>Drosophila </italic>by a nonalignment method for phylogenetic footprinting.</article-title><source>Proc Natl Acad Sci USA</source><year>2007</year><volume>104</volume><fpage>6305</fpage><lpage>6310</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">17395715</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B26"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Thompson</surname><given-names>W</given-names></name><name><surname>Palumbo</surname><given-names>MJ</given-names></name><name><surname>Wasserman</surname><given-names>WW</given-names></name><name><surname>Liu</surname><given-names>JS</given-names></name><name><surname>Lawrence</surname><given-names>CE</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Decoding human regulatory circuits.</article-title><source>Genome Res</source><year>2004</year><volume>14</volume><fpage>1967</fpage><lpage>1974</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">15466295</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B27"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Chan</surname><given-names>BY</given-names></name><name><surname>Kibler</surname><given-names>D</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Using hexamers to predict cis-regulatory motifs in <italic>Drosophila</italic>.</article-title><source>BMC Bioinformatics</source><year>2005</year><volume>6</volume><fpage>262</fpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">16253142</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B28"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Nazina</surname><given-names>AG</given-names></name><name><surname>Papatsenko</surname><given-names>DA</given-names></name></pers